{"unit_id":"nonewind__dsh-spend#card-zh","repo":"nonewind/dsh-spend","commit":"d621227bc878c748905743e1fde454979af10000","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-spend 是面向 DSH 网页端的用量与费用监控插件。它在网页界面提供悬浮统计面板，并由主机端服务读取会话日志、汇总 token 用量和按模型费率估算费用。面板可按供应商、模型、时间、会话查看统计，并展示支持供应商的实时配额或余额。适合想了解 DSH 会话消耗和订阅额度的用户；价格与配额可使用内置数据，也可配置覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:210","lib/stats.js:1","lib/client.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"nonewind__dsh-spend#card-en","repo":"nonewind/dsh-spend","commit":"d621227bc878c748905743e1fde454979af10000","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-spend monitors DSH web session usage and estimated costs. Its floating panel groups token totals by provider, model, time, and session, and shows live quota or balance for supported providers. It reads local session logs and prices usage with configurable model rates.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:210","lib/stats.js:1","lib/client.js:1"]}
